# Hot Wheels Spotter env reference.
#
# This repo is fully Supabase-backed. There are no backend env files — everything
# the backend needs is in supabase/config.toml (local) or your hosted Supabase
# project settings (prod).
#
# The *mobile* app reads EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars. Copy `apps/mobile/.env.local.example`
# to `apps/mobile/.env.local` and fill in values for release builds. Local dev
# auto-detects the `supabase start` instance so .env.local is optional locally.

# -------- Mobile (apps/mobile/.env.local) --------

# One of: local | staging | production. Gates dev-only UI (e.g. "Continue anonymously").
EXPO_PUBLIC_ENV=local

# Leave blank locally — the app auto-detects http://localhost:54321.
# REQUIRED for release builds:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon key from Supabase project settings>

# Optional crash reporting
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=https://examplePublicKey@o0.ingest.sentry.io/0
